{"id":9648,"date":"2025-11-13T10:41:35","date_gmt":"2025-11-13T10:41:35","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/?p=9648"},"modified":"2025-11-13T10:41:35","modified_gmt":"2025-11-13T10:41:35","slug":"think-spiders-are-harmless-5-health-problems-that-prove-you-need-pest-control-immediately","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/think-spiders-are-harmless-5-health-problems-that-prove-you-need-pest-control-immediately\/","title":{"rendered":"Think Spiders Are Harmless? 5 Health Problems That Prove You Need Pest Control Immediately"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In many Melbourne homes, spiders are often seen as harmless creatures that quietly take care of other insects.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">While it\u2019s true that spiders help control pests, certain Australian species can pose genuine health risks. From painful bites to potential allergic reactions, ignoring a spider infestation can affect both your comfort and your wellbeing.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Indoor spider infestations can quickly spread. Once spiders begin nesting in corners, air vents, or storage areas, the risk of bites, allergies and contamination increases. Their webs and droppings can also impact indoor air quality and hygiene.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Engaging a <\/span><b>professional spider removal service<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is the safest and most effective way to handle the problem. Experts not only remove existing spiders but also identify breeding spots and prevent future infestations.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For Melbourne homeowners, <\/span><b>7 States Pest Control<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> provides trusted, comprehensive treatments designed to protect your home and family from these unwanted pests.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">1. Painful and Venomous Spider Bites<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Australia is home to some of the world\u2019s most venomous spiders, and Melbourne is no exception. Common species such as the <\/span><b>Redback<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, <\/span><b>White-tailed<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and <\/span><b>Funnel-web spiders<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> are known for their painful bites and toxic venom.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Typical bite symptoms may include:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Swelling, redness, and localised pain<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Nausea or dizziness<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Muscle cramps or fever<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sweating or, in severe cases, vomiting<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">While not all bites are life-threatening, some may require urgent medical attention. Funnel-web spider bites, for instance, can lead to serious complications if not treated quickly.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A regular <\/span><b>spider removal service<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> helps prevent these encounters. By inspecting your home, identifying risk areas and removing webs and egg sacs, professionals ensure that dangerous spiders do not have the opportunity to settle or breed.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Choosing the <\/span><b>best pest control for spiders<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> means choosing experts who understand the behaviour and habitats of local species, ensuring long-term safety for your household.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2. Skin Infections and Allergic Reactions<\/span><\/h3>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-9652\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-11-10-at-12.39.02-PM-300x300.jpeg\" alt=\"best pest control for spiders\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-11-10-at-12.39.02-PM-300x300.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-11-10-at-12.39.02-PM-150x150.jpeg 150w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-11-10-at-12.39.02-PM-768x768.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-11-10-at-12.39.02-PM.jpeg 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Spider bites can cause different reactions depending on a person\u2019s sensitivity. Some people may only experience mild irritation, while others can develop severe allergic responses.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Common allergic or skin-related symptoms include:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Itching or red rashes<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Painful swelling near the bite site<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Blistering or slow-healing wounds<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In some rare cases, spider venom can lead to necrosis \u2013 damage to skin tissue that results in dark or dead patches around the wound. This can take weeks to heal and may even require medical care.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Using <\/span><b>professional pest control for spiders<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> minimises these risks. Trained technicians identify the type of spiders present, apply safe and targeted treatments, and ensure breeding areas are completely cleared.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This greatly reduces exposure to potential allergens and venomous bites, making <\/span><b>spider removal service<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> essential for maintaining a safe home.<\/span><\/p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">3. Breathing and Respiratory Issues<\/span><\/h4>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-9651\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-11-10-at-12.43.28-PM-300x300.jpeg\" alt=\"best pest control for spiders\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-11-10-at-12.43.28-PM-300x300.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-11-10-at-12.43.28-PM-150x150.jpeg 150w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-11-10-at-12.43.28-PM-768x768.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-11-10-at-12.43.28-PM.jpeg 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Old spider webs aren\u2019t just unpleasant to look at \u2013 they can also become a source of respiratory irritation. As time passes, webs trap dust, mould spores and fine particles that circulate through your home. Breathing in these contaminants can cause coughing, sneezing or lung irritation, particularly for people with asthma or sinus problems.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When spiders spin webs in ceiling corners, ducts or near vents, the risk of breathing difficulties increases.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/>\n<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> A comprehensive <\/span><b>spider removal service<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> not only removes spiders but also eliminates webs and hidden egg sacs. This helps improve air quality, making your indoor environment cleaner and safer.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Homeowners who rely on the <\/span><b>best pest control for spiders<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> in Melbourne enjoy cleaner air and reduced allergens \u2014 a crucial step toward better respiratory health.<\/span><\/p>\n<h5><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">4. Psychological Stress and Sleep Problems<\/span><\/h5>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For many people, the presence of spiders can be unsettling. Even harmless species can cause discomfort or fear, especially for individuals with arachnophobia. Living in a space where spiders frequently appear can increase anxiety levels and lead to constant unease.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In some cases, the fear of spiders can affect sleep quality. The thought of encountering one at night can make it difficult to relax or fall asleep peacefully.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/>\n<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Routine <\/span><b>spider removal services<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> eliminate this ongoing worry. When your home is professionally treated, you can rest easy knowing that corners and furniture are free of webs and spiders.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Choosing the <\/span><b>best pest control for spiders<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> ensures a peaceful environment where you and your family can sleep without stress or fear.<\/span><\/p>\n<h6><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">5. Bacterial Contamination in Hidden Areas<\/span><\/h6>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Spiders often live in dark, undisturbed areas such as garages, attics, basements and storage cupboards. These spaces can accumulate bacteria, dust and dirt over time. Spider droppings, along with the remains of trapped insects, can create unhygienic conditions and contaminate surfaces.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When these hidden areas are not cleaned properly, bacteria and allergens may spread to nearby spaces. This can indirectly impact food safety and household hygiene.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The <\/span><b>best pest control for spiders<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> involves more than just killing spiders\u2014it includes cleaning webs, disinfecting surfaces and removing residue.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/>\n<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> This comprehensive <\/span><b>spider removal service<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> ensures your home remains healthy and hygienic long after treatment is completed.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Professional Spider Removal Service \u2013 Your Long-Term Solution<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Attempting to control spiders with sprays or DIY traps may offer short-term relief but rarely addresses the root cause. A <\/span><b>professional spider control service<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> provides a complete and lasting solution that targets the source of infestation.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-9650\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-11-10-at-12.51.01-PM-300x300.jpeg\" alt=\"best pest control for spiders\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-11-10-at-12.51.01-PM-300x300.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-11-10-at-12.51.01-PM-150x150.jpeg 150w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-11-10-at-12.51.01-PM-768x768.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-11-10-at-12.51.01-PM.jpeg 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A professional spider removal treatment usually includes:<\/span><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Detailed inspection:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Experts examine both indoor and outdoor areas such as roof spaces, window frames, sheds and garden edges.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n<p><\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Safe treatment application:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Eco-friendly, non-toxic products are used to eliminate spiders without harming your family or pets.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n<p><\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Web and egg sac removal:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Removing existing webs and egg sacs prevents future hatching and infestations.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n<p><\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Preventive measures:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Technicians offer recommendations for sealing entry points and maintaining cleanliness.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n<p><\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Follow-up visits:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Periodic inspections ensure continued protection throughout the year.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n<p><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This approach guarantees long-term results and peace of mind. <\/span><b>7 States Pest Control<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> uses proven methods and high-grade products to ensure spiders are completely eradicated from your property.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Protect Your Health and Home Today<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Spiders may seem harmless at first, but their presence inside your home can lead to a range of health and hygiene problems. From painful bites and skin infections to respiratory irritation and psychological distress, the risks are too serious to ignore.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">With <\/span><b>7 States Pest Control<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, you get Melbourne\u2019s <\/span><b>best pest control for spiders<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, offering safe, reliable, and long-lasting protection for your property. Their expert <\/span><b>spider removal service<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> ensures that spiders, webs, and egg sacs are completely removed \u2014 preventing re-infestation and keeping your home healthy, hygienic, and pest-free all year round.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Taking action early is always the best approach. Professional pest control ensures that spiders, webs and egg sacs are removed completely, preventing the problem from returning.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you\u2019ve noticed an increase in spiders around your property or want to ensure your home is safe, book a professional <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/spider-control-treatment-melbourne\/\"><b>spider removal service<\/b> <\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">with <\/span><b>7 States Pest Control<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u2014 the <\/span><b>best pest control for spiders in Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Don\u2019t wait for a spider bite to remind you of the danger.<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/contact-us\/\"><b>Book a professional spider removal service with 7 States Pest Control<\/b><\/a><b> \u2014 the best pest control for spiders in Melbourne.<\/b><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>In many Melbourne homes, spiders are often seen as harmless creatures that quietly take care of other insects.\u00a0 While it\u2019s true that spiders help control pests, certain Australian species can pose genuine health risks. From painful bites to potential allergic reactions, ignoring a spider infestation can affect both your comfort and your wellbeing. Indoor spider [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":9649,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[18],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-9648","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-spider-control-melbourne"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v25.4 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Think Spiders Are Harmless? Get Expert Spider Removal Service in Melbourne<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Discover why spiders aren\u2019t as harmless as they seem. Learn 5 health risks and why 7 States Pest Control offers the best pest control for spiders in Melbourne\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/think-spiders-are-harmless-5-health-problems-that-prove-you-need-pest-control-immediately\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Think Spiders Are Harmless? Get Expert Spider Removal Service in Melbourne\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Discover why spiders aren\u2019t as harmless as they seem. Learn 5 health risks and why 7 States Pest Control offers the best pest control for spiders in Melbourne\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/think-spiders-are-harmless-5-health-problems-that-prove-you-need-pest-control-immediately\/\" \/>\n<met